pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">不过在</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">3</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">月份的震荡过程当中</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">有过看短线反弹</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">分析有一些瑕疵</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></font></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第三个阶段</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">4</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">月</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">7</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">号行情暴跌</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">我们进场抄底</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">并且进的三个重点方向</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">恒生科技医药和创业板</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">都是大涨</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">之后的几个月一直持有不动</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，这一阶段的交易布局收效显著。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">直到</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">8</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">月下旬到</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">9</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">月</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">开始调仓进防御性板块</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">重点进的是券商和煤炭</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">但这段时间也非常煎熬</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">因为没有做科技</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">而煤炭一直在低位震荡</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">直播间人数也再次大幅减少</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></font></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第四个阶段十一之后</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">银行煤炭红利出现大涨</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">而科技大跌</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">又到了分析很准的时间</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">最后就是最近这一个多月</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">科技创业板强势反弹</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">而银行红利再次下跌</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">又遇到了煎熬的时刻</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">回</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">顾这一年</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">每当一段时间我们分析不太准</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">接下来就会很准</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">而每当我们分析很准之后</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">可能要遇到煎熬时刻</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">没有人能在任何时间分析对所有行情</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">展望</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">2026</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">年</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">我的大概判断是</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">：</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">先以红利板块做防守</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">等行情震荡回调结束之后</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">再以传统板块做进攻</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">科技仍然不配</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">而且未来一到两年</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">都很难有超额收益</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">！</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">让我们拭目以待</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">!</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">同时再给大家一个忠告</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">朱少醒的富国天惠基金年化收益率</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">20%</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">10</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">年翻了</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">15</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">倍</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">但是买它基金的基民大部分都是亏钱的</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">因为他们都是涨起来才进场</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">跌下去又割掉了</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">所以交易要逆人性</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">不是看它短期收益很高就去跟</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">那样你很可能追在最高点</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">但也不是说要去进那个弱的</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">而要选择一个长期收益很好</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">但短期因为一些外部因素导致收益不好的时候</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">敢于进场</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">！</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">刘广义 A0630624060004  投资有风险  入市需谨慎</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">个人观点  仅供参考  案例截图  不做投资依据</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">上海凯石证券投资咨询有限公司</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p></div>",
